# Flexoki Dark — ghostty colours.
# Pulled in by ghostty/config via config-file, through ghostty/theme.

theme = Flexoki Dark

# bold-is-bright is deliberately unset here. Ghostty's bundled Flexoki Dark
# maps normal ANSI to the 400 level but bright to 600, so bright colours 1-6
# are darker than their normal counterparts; promoting bold text into that
# inverted half made bold render dimmer than regular text. It is also
# deprecated as of Ghostty 1.2.0 in favour of bold-color.
